ering within the event group.</p>', ], ], 'SnsMessageAttributeMap' => [ 'base' => '<p>Map of SNS message attribute names to values. At most 50 attributes; SNS also enforces its own per-message attribute limits on delivery.</p>', 'refs' => [ 'SnsParameters$MessageAttributes' => '<p>Custom message attributes for SNS filtering.</p>', ], ], 'SnsMessageAttributeValue' => [ 'base' => '<p>A custom SNS message attribute (data type plus string or binary value).</p>', 'refs' => [ 'SnsMessageAttributeMap$value' => NULL, ], ], 'SnsMessageAttributeValueDataTypeString' => [ 'base' => NULL, 'refs' => [ 'SnsMessageAttributeValue$DataType' => '<p>Attribute data type. Requiredness and the accepted vocabulary belong to SNS, which rejects an attribute without a data type on delivery.</p>', ], ], 'SnsParameters' => [ 'base' => '<p>SNS invocation parameters for subscribers. Values are forwarded to the SNS PublishBatch API. All scalar values accept a literal or a JSONata expression (e.g. &quot;{% $events.Data.groupId %}&quot;).</p>', 'refs' => [ 'InvokeConfiguration$SnsParameters' => NULL, 'UpdateInvokeConfiguration$SnsParameters' => NULL, ], ], 'SnsParametersMessageDeduplicationIdString' => [ 'base' => NULL, 'refs' => [ 'SnsParameters$MessageDeduplicationId' => '<p>Message deduplication ID for FIFO topics. Accepts JSONata expression.</p>', ], ], 'SnsParametersMessageGroupIdString' => [ 'base' => NULL, 'refs' => [ 'SnsParameters$MessageGroupId' => '<p>Message group ID for FIFO topics. Accepts JSONata expression.</p>', ], ], 'SnsParametersMessageStructureString' => [ 'base' => NULL, 'refs' => [ 'SnsParameters$MessageStructure' => '<p>Per-protocol message formatting mode, forwarded to SNS Publish unchanged. Accepts JSONata expression.</p>', ], ], 'SnsParametersSubjectString' => [ 'base' => NULL, 'refs' => [ 'SnsParameters$Subject' => '<p>Subject line for email protocol subscriptions. Accepts JSONata expression.</p>', ], ], 'Source' => [ 'base' => '<p>The source of an event, e.g. &quot;myapp